{"title":"Career roadmap — Librarian","role":"Librarian","summary":"A Librarian manages information resources, digital and physical collections, cataloguing, classification, research support, information discovery and user services. Modern librarians increasingly work with digital libraries, institutional repositories, databases, metadata, research analytics and information technology rather than only physical books.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Library & Information Science (BLIS/B.Lib)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build library science, cataloguing, classification, information retrieval and digital-library skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in academic, public, corporate, digital or research-library services"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Librarian, Library Manager, Information Specialist or Digital Library Specialist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead knowledge-management systems, digital libraries, institutional repositories or information-services teams"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Library science foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Library and information science fundamentals"},{"text":"Types of libraries"},{"text":"Library management"},{"text":"Collection development"},{"text":"Information sources"},{"text":"Reference services"},{"text":"User services"},{"text":"Library ethics"},{"text":"Information literacy"},{"text":"Basics of documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Books"},{"text":"Journals"},{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Reference materials"},{"text":"E-books"},{"text":"Online databases"},{"text":"Institutional repositories"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Output","text":"Create a sample library collection-development plan."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Cataloguing & information organisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Bibliographic records"},{"text":"Information retrieval"},{"text":"Subject indexing"},{"text":"Authority control"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Preservation"},{"text":"Archival fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn major concepts/systems such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DDC"},{"text":"UDC"},{"text":"LCC"},{"text":"MARC"},{"text":"RDA"},{"text":"Dublin Core"},{"text":"OPAC"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Database fundamentals"},{"text":"Library Management Systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Digital libraries & information technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Build skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital library management"},{"text":"Institutional repositories"},{"text":"E-resource management"},{"text":"Research databases"},{"text":"Open-access resources"},{"text":"Research support"},{"text":"Bibliometrics"},{"text":"Citation analysis"},{"text":"Research data management"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Information literacy training"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL basics"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Metadata standards"},{"text":"Repository platforms"},{"text":"Library automation systems"},{"text":"Basic web technologies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong projects could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital library management system"},{"text":"Institutional repository implementation"},{"text":"Library user-behaviour analysis"},{"text":"Research database discovery system"},{"text":"Library automation project"},{"text":"Digital preservation framework"},{"text":"Bibliometr